WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Juri blocks the recorded OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.750
Forward heavy Punish Counters the reversal recovery.

3
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.750
The first Rush cancel links forward heavy and crouching medium.

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.250
Crouching medium punch links after the first Rush’s forward heavy; the second cancel follows.

5
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.250
The second cancel exhausts Juri’s remaining Drive.

6
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.250
Enhanced Go Ohsatsu leads into the light and medium follow-ups.

7
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:09.750
Forward medium links into unstocked Go Ohsatsu after all three Fuha stocks are spent.

8
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:19.250
Kaisen Dankairaku activates after the extended full-spend route.

9
00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.450
The normal-health Level 3 completes the cash-out.
